.theme layout:{hyperlegible}

.extend {paragraph}
    content:
    .super
        .content::match {Quarkdown}
            ***.1***

.extend {link}
    .super foreground:{forestgreen}

.extend {link} where:{url: .url::startswith {https://quarkdown.com}::not}
    content:
    .super
        .content .icon {box-arrow-up-right}

Quarkdown is free!  
Check out Quarkdown's [docs](https://quarkdown.com/docs)
and [repo](https://github.com/iamgio/quarkdown) to get started.
